'''Guanic bats''' can be found inside the [[Chambers of Xeric]] where they can be caught using a [[butterfly net]] in order to obtain a [[Raw guanic bat (0)]]. They require a [[Hunter]] level of 1 to catch and grant 5 Hunter experience. Once caught, guanic bats can be cooked into a [[Guanic bat (0)]], requiring a [[cooking]] level of 1.

